menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_LONG_TERM_MEMORY
    bool "Enable guardian-authorized long-term memory"
    default y
    help
        Stores a bounded set of guardian-authorized facts about a child
        (preferences, routines, milestones the companion should recall) with a
        minimal, deletion-capable, consent-gated store. Revoking authorization
        erases every remembered fact.

endmenu
